    description: "Follow-up to WI-bapal-sanok-vujoj-jisub-duzor-dojuz-misiz-fudok. discovery.INSTALLED_DEP_RULES covers Mix deps/, node_modules/, Composer vendor/, Go vendor/, Bundler vendor/bundle, CocoaPods Pods/, virtualenvs; BUILD_OUTPUT_RULES covers Mix cover/, Phoenix priv/static/assets, .dart_tool, .stack-work, elm-stuff (+ .elixir_ls by name). Not covered, so analysed if present: Carthage/Checkouts (Cartfile.resolved beside), Yarn PnP .yarn/cache (zips; .pnp.cjs beside), bower_components (bower.json beside), Swift PM .build/checkouts (Package.resolved beside), cargo vendor output (vendor/ with .cargo/config.toml source replacement + per-crate .cargo-checksum.json), Bundler installs outside vendor/bundle (BUNDLE_PATH in .bundle/config), and Phoenix mix phx.digest output (per-file priv/static/*-<32hex>.* beside cache_manifest.json -- needs a per-file rule, not a directory rule). Each needs a marker check, a package listing for --trace-deps, and a fixture test in test_installed_dependency_source.py."  # 75c7
